Build fuchsia-inspect without its test deps (milestone M9b).

test_deps are dropped: //rules:rustc.bzl makes no unit tests until milestone M16, and
regen.py would otherwise fetch crates outside the closure (assert_matches) or fail on
in-tree test deps it does not vendor
(//src/lib/diagnostics/testing/diagnostics-assertions/rust, //src/lib/fuchsia).

The added lines are the overlay's (Apache-2.0); the context lines are Fuchsia's
(BSD-2-Clause, LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt). Applied by scripts/regen.py to the rewritten
BUILD.bazel.

--- a/src/lib/diagnostics/inspect/rust/BUILD.bazel
+++ b/src/lib/diagnostics/inspect/rust/BUILD.bazel
@@ -61,11 +61,8 @@
         "@rust_crates//vendor:derivative",
         "@rust_crates//vendor:paste",
     ],
-    test_deps = [
-        "//vendor/fuchsia/src/lib/diagnostics/testing/diagnostics-assertions/rust:diagnostics-assertions",
-        "//vendor/fuchsia/src/lib/fuchsia",
-        "@rust_crates//vendor:assert_matches",
-    ],
+    # Overlay: unit tests are milestone M16 (patch 0001).
+    test_deps = [],
     version = "0.1.0",
     visibility = ["//vendor/fuchsia:__subpackages__"],
     with_unit_tests = True,
